          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "WHAT THE DATA SAYS",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#B4400F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Adjusted for size, Truist overtook Chase in 2026: 14.8 vs 12.7 fraud complaints per $10B of deposits (2025: 12.2 vs 13.8).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#111111"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Truist fraud complaints are on pace for +20.7% year over year, while the three-bank total falls 3.6%.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#111111"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Amex gives some relief on 30.3% of closed fraud complaints but money back on only 4.5%: most of its fraud is identity theft, fixed without refunds.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#111111"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#111111"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "METHOD",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#B4400F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Fraud = CFPB issue/sub-issue allow-list (version-controlled dbt seed). Current year annualized = year-to-date × 365 ÷ days elapsed to the data cutoff. Deposits = period-end 6/30/2026 from SEC filings; both years divided by the same deposit base. Amex excluded from the size-normalized view because deposits understate a card issuer's customer base.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "color": "#4A4A4A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
